TCP isn't simply:
CONNECTED
It has a state machine.
You'll encounter states such as:
LISTEN
SYN-SENT
SYN-RECEIVED
ESTABLISHED
FIN-WAIT
CLOSE-WAIT
TIME-WAIT
CLOSED
The most important one for our current path:
