18. Closing TCP
Eventually one side wants to close.
Suppose client initiates.
It sends:
FIN
Conceptually:
Client                         LB

   FIN ──────────────────────►
The LB acknowledges:
       ◄──────────────── ACK
Then the LB eventually sends its own:
       ◄──────────────── FIN
Client acknowledges:
   ACK ──────────────────────►
Conceptually:
FIN
ACK
FIN
ACK
The exact state transitions are more nuanced, but that's the mental model.
