28. Algorithm comparison
Algorithm	Main idea	Strength	Weakness
Round Robin	Rotate servers	Very cheap	Ignores workload
Weighted RR	Rotate according to capacity	Handles different server capacities	Still doesn't see current load
Least Connections	Choose lowest active connections	Adapts to current connection load	Connections ≠ actual work
Weighted Least Connections	Load relative to capacity	Better for heterogeneous servers	More state
IP Hash	Same client tends toward same backend	Locality/session affinity	Hotspots/remapping
Random	Random backend	Very simple	No load awareness
Power of Two	Pick 2, choose better	Excellent efficiency	Needs load metric
